{"num":538,"id":"2021-002","year":"2021","num0":"002","stars":3,"univ":"지바대학교","track":"의학부·이과","subj":"대수","text":"(1) 어떤 상수 C 에 대하여 다음 등식이 모든 실수 θ에서 성립함을 보이고 C 를 구하여라. 2π 4π 6π 8π sin θ sin (θ + ) sin (θ ","qimg":["p/jp/2021-002-q0.webp"],"simg":["p/jp/2021-002-s0.webp"],"ja":[{"p":"(1) ある定数 $C$ に対して次の等式がすべての実数 $\\theta$ で成り立つことを示し、$C$ を求めよ。"},{"eq":"\\sin\\theta\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{2\\pi}5\\right)\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{4\\pi}5\\right)\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{6\\pi}5\\right)\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{8\\pi}5\\right)=C\\sin5\\theta"},{"p":"(2) $\\sin\\dfrac\\pi{10}\\sin\\dfrac{3\\pi}{10}$ を求めよ。"}],"sim":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) 次の等式がすべての実数 $\\theta$ で成り立つことを示せ。"},{"eq":"\\sin\\theta\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{2\\pi}3\\right)=\\frac14\\sin3\\theta"},{"p":"(2) $\\sin20^\\circ\\sin40^\\circ\\sin80^\\circ$ の値を求めよ。"}],"ans":{"ja":"(2) $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}8$"},"sol":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) $\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{2\\pi}3\\right)=\\dfrac12\\left\\{\\cos\\frac\\pi3-\\cos\\left(2\\theta+\\pi\\right)\\right\\}=\\dfrac14+\\dfrac12\\cos2\\theta$。"},{"p":"$\\sin\\theta\\left(\\frac14+\\frac12\\cos2\\theta\\right)=\\frac14\\sin\\theta+\\frac14(\\sin3\\theta-\\sin\\theta)=\\frac14\\sin3\\theta$。"},{"p":"(2) $\\theta=20^\\circ$ とすると左辺は $\\sin20^\\circ\\sin80^\\circ\\sin140^\\circ=\\sin20^\\circ\\sin40^\\circ\\sin80^\\circ$、右辺は $\\frac14\\sin60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}8$。"}]}},"art":""}